| **Actual Anupa** | Doubt (*Kaṅkhā*) | **Pācittiya (Pc)** | **Tika Pācittiya** |
| **Actual Anupa** | Upa-saññā | **Pācittiya (Pc)** | **Tika Pācittiya** |
| **Actual Upa** | Anupa-saññā | **Dukkaṭa (dkṭ)** | **Duka Dukkaṭa** |
| **Actual Upa** | Doubt (*Kaṅkhā*) | **Dukkaṭa (dkṭ)** | **Duka Dukkaṭa** |
| **Actual Upa** | Upa-saññā | **No Offense (Anāpatti)**| **Duka Dukkaṭa** |

